80
00:07:05,369 --> 00:07:07,598
It had made his history flawless.

81
00:07:08,168 --> 00:07:13,838
It was, as the narrator warned you, the first mistake
the System ever made on his behalf.

82
00:07:13,858 --> 00:07:18,952
And the man it had been made for would not learn
about it for another two years.

83
00:07:21,024 --> 00:07:23,482
He found the Delgado report in March.

84
00:07:24,052 --> 00:07:29,752
It was in a state environmental database, four years
old — a routine inspection of the

85
00:07:29,772 --> 00:07:36,071
old building in the autumn of twenty twenty-six,
prompted by a complaint from the then-landlord

86
00:07:36,091 --> 00:07:41,925
