complaint had been closed as unfounded. The

87
00:07:41,945 --> 00:07:47,646
facility had been described as exemplary in its
cooperation. The only deficiency noted

88
00:07:47,666 --> 00:07:53,433
was a solvent store on the second floor, which the
director had asked — in writing — to

89
00:07:53,453 --> 00:07:54,298
