100
00:08:45,527 --> 00:08:48,952
He met Hannah Price in April. It
was her idea.

101
00:08:49,523 --> 00:08:55,096
She had written to him through the Bureau's public
affairs office, which was procedure,

102
00:08:55,116 --> 00:09:00,818
and then, when public affairs had declined on his
