115
00:09:50,053 --> 00:09:51,378
hundred and fourteen.

116
00:09:52,067 --> 00:09:53,739
What do you have that I don't?

117
00:09:55,259 --> 00:09:59,438
A man named Rick Dorsey. He's a deacon at a church
