122
00:10:19,057 --> 00:10:20,087
Arcturus.

123
00:10:20,607 --> 00:10:21,356
What?

124
00:10:21,876 --> 00:10:27,595
The air handler. The one that isn't there anymore.
The state inspector saw it in twenty

125
00:10:27,615 --> 00:10:33,465
