141
00:11:40,815 --> 00:11:43,475
The policeman and the journalist.

142
00:11:43,995 --> 00:11:44,634
Yes.

143
00:11:45,154 --> 00:11:51,095
This is how it begins. Always. Two people in a room
who have seen the same thing. Then

144
00:11:51,115 --> 00:11:56,987
